Demam awak dah hilang.

00:36:44.400 --> 00:36:45.520
Terima kasih.

00:36:46.640 --> 00:36:47.680
Selepas beberapa hari lagi,

00:36:48.000 --> 00:36:49.680
keradangan itu sepatutnya hilang.

00:37:18.720 --> 00:37:19.760
Ubat apa ni?

00:37:20.560 --> 00:37:21.760
Penisilin.

00:37:25.080 --> 00:37:27.800
Adakah terdapat

00:37:27.800 --> 00:37:29.720
di hospital pangkalan baru-baru ini?

00:37:30.080 --> 00:37:30.880
Tidak.

00:37:30.880 --> 00:37:31.760
Sama sekali tidak.

00:37:32.480 --> 00:37:33.520
Awak pasti?

